        {
          "segment_id": "summary",
          "type": "summary",
          "source_text": "One morning at home, a father and child talk about an overgrown vacant lot and wonder what “soil” and “weeds” might mean for a person.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_summary_en-us.mp3",
