          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "001"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "I was thinking about your construction site.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:08+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "note:002",
          "type": "note",
          "source_text": "On the way home from school, they passed a vacant lot overgrown with weeds. They hadn't seen it all summer, and the weeds were now about 50 centimeters tall.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_note_002_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:10+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "002"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "What's the point of thinking about that?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_003_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:11+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "7QN34D2r3hCNwbOYIeK0",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "child"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "The buildings at the site were torn down, leaving bare soil behind. Leave it alone for a few months, and weeds start growing.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:13+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "note:004",
          "type": "note",
          "source_text": "The buildings on the vacant lot were torn down before summer vacation. Once all the construction debris had been hauled away, only bare soil remained.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_note_004_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:16+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "004"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "And here's the poetic angle: if a person were left untended for a few months, would they become overgrown with weeds too?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_005_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:17+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "But for a person, what would the soil be? And what would the weeds be?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_006_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:19+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "gOupLcAkjEnguROwi4oS",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "note:006",
          "type": "note",
          "source_text": "The key question is: what does it mean to tend to a person?",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_note_006_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
          "generated_at": "2026-09-12T15:44:20+08:00",
          "generation": {
            "provider": "ElevenLabs",
            "voice_id": "ktkP7Nsj67dw2zcplQYt",
            "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
            "output_format": "mp3_44100_128",
            "speed": 0.9,
            "similarity_boost": 1.0
          },
          "sequence": "006"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "Now I want to go pick some foxtail grass.",
          "file": "elevenlabs/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_007_en-us.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": true,
