        {
          "segment_id": "title",
          "type": "title",
          "source_text": "人也会长满草吗",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_title_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:001",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "为什么起来了？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_001_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "001",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:002",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我想起你的工地了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_002_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "002",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:003",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "想这个有什么用？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_003_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "003",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:004",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "工地拆了房子，留下那些土在上面。几个月不打理就长草了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_004_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "004",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:005",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "然后诗人的角度就是：人几个月不打理，是不是也会长满了草？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_005_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "005",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:006",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "但对于人来说，什么是土呢？然后什么是草呢？",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_006_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "006",
          "speaker": "父亲"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "dialogue:007",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "source_text": "我都想去摘狗尾巴草了。",
          "file": "zh-cn/2026-09-04-can-people-become-overgrown-with-weeds-too_dialogue_007_zh-cn.mp3",
          "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
          "ai_generated": false,
          "sequence": "007",
          "speaker": "孩子"
        }
      ]
    }
